<view class="page"><view class="title">损坏归还接续维修</view><view class="hint">由资产管理员办理。保留原归还与已关闭借用，继承同一锁和原库管；仍需批准范围、实际接修与验收入库。</view>
<view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><button bindtap="onRefresh" disabled="{{busy}}">刷新损坏后续</button><button wx:if="{{retry}}" bindtap="onRetry" disabled="{{busy}}">重试原接续申请</button>
<view wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view>归还 {{item.return_id}} · 资产 {{item.asset_id}} · {{item.reason}}</view><view>{{item.followup_status === 'PENDING' ? '待接续' : item.followup_status === 'CLOSED' ? '已实际完成' : '维修处理中'}} · {{item.repair_status}}</view>
<button wx:if="{{item.followup_status === 'PENDING'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onSelect" disabled="{{busy || retry || prepared}}">核对损坏来源</button><button wx:if="{{item.linked_repair_id || item.last_repair_id}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="onOpen" disabled="{{busy || retry || prepared}}">查看原维修与进度</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{source}}" class="card"><view>{{source.asset.assetCode}} · {{source.asset.name}} · 原归还 {{source.returnId}} · 原库管 {{source.processorAccountId}}</view><view>实际损坏验收 {{source.inspectedAt}} · {{source.inspectionReason}}。原借用 {{source.closedLoanId || '无'}} 不重开。</view>
<textarea value="{{fault}}" data-field="fault" bindinput="onField" maxlength="2000" disabled="{{busy || retry || prepared}}"/><picker range="{{['轻度','中度','严重']}}" data-field="impact" bindchange="onField" disabled="{{busy || retry || prepared}}"><view>影响程度 {{impact}}</view></picker><button bindtap="onPrepare" disabled="{{busy || retry || prepared}}">核对接续申请</button></view>
<view wx:if="{{prepared}}" class="card"><view>将创建待批准正式维修并继承同一资产锁；不会自动批准、虚构接修或重开借用。</view><button bindtap="onConfirm" disabled="{{busy}}">确认提交损坏接续</button><button bindtap="onEdit" disabled="{{busy}}">返回修改接续</button></view>
<button wx:if="{{repairId}}" bindtap="onOpen" disabled="{{busy || retry || prepared}}">查看新维修并核对范围审批</button>
<button wx:if="{{page > 1}}" data-delta="-1" bindtap="onPage" disabled="{{busy || retry || prepared}}">上一页损坏后续</button><view>第{{page}}页 / 共{{total}}项</view><button wx:if="{{page * 20 < total}}" data-delta="1" bindtap="onPage" disabled="{{busy || retry || prepared}}">下一页损坏后续</button><navigator url="/pages/repairs/index" open-type="redirect">返回维修</navigator></view>
